WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
This is my DishDecide application, an Easy Ethiopian Meal Picker.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
First, users set their food budget.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
They choose between fasting and non-fasting meals.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Next, they select breakfast, lunch, dinner, or snacks.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Users choose whether they eat alone or with others.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
They select their preferred price: low, medium, or high.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
DishDecide recommends meals based on their preferences.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
After eating, the meal cost is deducted from the budget.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Users can save favorites and change their profile avatar.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Thank you for watching my demonstration!